<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:po="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation/options">

    <!--
    ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
    ║  RMC.BestFit.UI Icon Dictionary                                              ║
    ╠═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
    ║  Theme-aware vector icons for BestFit UI elements. Icons use DynamicResource ║
    ║  bindings to adapt to light/dark/blue themes.                                ║
    ║                                                                              ║
    ║  THEME RESOURCES USED:                                                       ║
    ║  • ToolbarIconForeground    - Main stroke/fill (dark in light, light in dark) ║
    ║  • ToolbarIconDocumentFill  - Cell/document background fill                  ║
    ║  • ToolbarIconAccent        - Accent color (blue cylinder/clock element)      ║
    ║                                                                              ║
    ║  ICON FORMAT:                                                                ║
    ║  Icons are defined as DrawingImage with po:Freeze="False" and x:Shared="False"║
    ║  so each resolution creates a fresh unfrozen instance whose DynamicResource   ║
    ║  bindings remain active. Element nodes use SetResourceReference to bind to    ║
    ║  these icons, which re-resolves on theme change.                             ║
    ║                                                                              ║
    ║  USAGE (code-behind):                                                        ║
    ║  nodeHeader.SetResourceReference(StaticImageProperty, "InputDataIcon");      ║
    ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
    -->

